#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build approved NST wiki PDF slices as local review artifacts.

All non-cover content is sourced from wiki markdown via MkDocs-rendered HTML.
The markdown files under documentation/docs/ are the single source of truth
for PDF content.  Templates are NOT used as content sources.

Content flow:
  docs/*.md  →  MkDocs build  →  merged HTML (articles)  →  Playwright  →  PDF

Current implemented targets:
- cover
- page2              (index.md + installation.md)
- technical-details  (techSpecs.md)
- menu               (menus.md)
- special-thanks     (about.md § Special Thanks)
- contact            (about.md § Contact)
- pages-1-2
- pages-1-5
- full-so-far

The script is intentionally target-based so each approved section can be
rebuilt and locked independently before the later combined book pipeline.
"""

